/// Ledger need
///
/// kernel ledger.rs: a piece of the ledger a decision or read needs (need.ledger). account is the header of one account; entry-by-key the entry of an account with that idempotency key, when there is one; entries at most limit entries of an account numbered above after, in order; ranked the first offset + limit accounts of a unit and scope in order of balance, equal balances in ascending order of the owner (LDG-1543); unit-used and pool-used one account of the unit or of the pool, when there is one (LDG-1549). limit is the limit of the one account of that owner, unit and scope, when it has one (D-6554); limits every limit of single accounts, to count and to list them; expiring at most limit accounts of the unit whose oldest bucket starts at or before cutoff, in order of that start and then of the account id, found through an index (D-6553).
